  - name: GxVAEs
    type: MODEL
    description: "A novel deep generative model for de novo molecular generation, incorporating disease-related cellular environments (gene expression profiles) into the generation process. It comprises two joint Variational Autoencoders (VAEs): ProfileVAE and MolVAE."
  - name: ProfileVAE
    type: MODEL_COMPONENT
    description: "The first VAE in GxVAEs, acting as a feature extractor to learn low-dimensional feature vectors from high-dimensional gene expression profiles."
  - name: MolVAE
    type: MODEL_COMPONENT
    description: "The second VAE in GxVAEs, conditioned on features extracted by ProfileVAE, which generates hit-like molecules represented by SMILES strings."
  - name: Gene Expression Profiles
    type: DATA
