  - name: ExpressionGAN
    type: MODEL
    description: "A state-of-the-art baseline model for molecular generation, used for comparison with GxVAEs."
  - name: TRIOMPHE
    type: MODEL
    description: "A state-of-the-art baseline model for molecular generation, used for comparison with GxVAEs, particularly in generating ligand-like molecules."
  - name: DRAGONET
    type: MODEL
    description: "A model used for comparison with GxVAEs in generating therapeutic molecules from disease reversal profiles."

