resenting the activity of genes in specific cellular environments or diseases. Used as input for ProfileVAE to extract relevant biological features.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1]}, 'Latent Features': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['Low-dimensional representations derived from gene expression profiles by ProfileVAE, serving as conditional inputs for MolVAE to guide molecule generation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Hit-like Molecules': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Molecules generated by GxVAEs that exhibit potential bioactivity and drug-like properties, relevant for drug discovery.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Computer-Aided Drug Discovery': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The field focused on using computational methods and AI to accelerate the process of discovering new drugs.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Deep Generative Models': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A class of AI models, including GANs and VAEs, capable of learning data distributions and generating new data samples, applied here for molecular generation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Variational Autoencoders (VAEs)': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A type of deep generative model that learns a probabilistic mapping from input data to a latent space and back, used as core components in GxVAEs.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'SMILES Strings': {'type': ['dataset', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A linear notation for describing the structure of chemical molecules, used by MolVAE for molecular representation and generation.', 'A linear notation for describing the structure of chemical molecules. GxVAEs generates molecules represented by SMILES strings, aiming for hit-like and therapeutic properties.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1]}, 'Bidirectional GRUs': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A type of recurrent neural network architecture used within MolVAE, capable of processing sequential data in both forward and backward directions.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]},